<div class="hero-lead"><p class="hero-kicker">Pricing</p><h1>Give your security and privacy the attention they deserve.</h1><p>You can come with a concern or simply a wish to take better care of your digital life. Dr. Lior Tabansky works with you, in person: first to inspect relevant access, diagnose what matters and make approved urgent fixes within scope; then, through a separately agreed full engagement, to harden your setup and teach you how to use it.</p><p><strong><a class="btn" href="#contact">Request a private conversation</a></strong></p><p class="trust">In person &#xB7; With you present &#xB7; You control your credentials</p><p><strong>All prices include VAT.</strong></p></div></div></section><nav class="page-index wrap" aria-label="On this page" data-presentation-ui><a href="#your-first-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid">First paid visit</a><a href="#strengthen-your-security-and-privacy-with-help-using-the-changes">Full services</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a></nav><div class="detail-controls wrap" data-presentation-ui><button type="button" data-expand-details aria-expanded="false">Show all details</button><span>Open any heading for more, or show everything.</span></div><section class="copy-section copy-offer" id="your-first-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid" aria-labelledby="your-first-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="your-first-paid-visit-inspection-diagnosis-and-urgent-first-aid-heading">Your first paid visit: inspection, diagnosis and urgent first aid</h2><p><strong>Private Exposure Assessment &#xB7; Typically four hours</strong></p><p class="offer-price"><strong>&#x20AA;3,600 including VAT</strong></p></div><div class="section-detail">


<p>This is hands-on work with you, on one main phone and one other device: a PC, iPad or second phone. Dr. Tabansky inspects relevant identities, accounts, apps, permissions and recovery routes, including access to messages, photos, documents and location information.</p>
<details class="supporting-detail"><summary><span data-presentation-ui>What we examine, fix and record</span></summary><div class="detail-content"><ul>
<li><strong>Have someone examine what you cannot easily see.</strong> Dr. Tabansky examines how the relevant devices, identities and services connect, what access those connections allow and which changes should come first. You receive an interpretation of your own setup, including connections you may not have known to ask about.</li>
<li><strong>Have urgent problems addressed during the visit.</strong> Where urgent exposure can safely be fixed within the agreed scope, Dr. Tabansky explains the change and makes it with your approval.</li>
<li><strong>Receive a practical summary.</strong> See what was reviewed, what was found, what changed, what remains and the recommended next steps. You receive this even if you buy nothing further.</li>
</ul></div></details>
<p>The visit completes the agreed intake, access mapping, diagnosis and approved urgent first aid.</p>
<p><strong><a href="/en/private-exposure-assessment.html">See the initial visit in detail</a></strong></p>
</div></div></section>
<section class="copy-section is-disclosure" id="before-you-book" aria-labelledby="before-you-book-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><details class="section-disclosure"><summary><h2 id="before-you-book-heading">Before you book</h2></summary><div class="section-detail">
<p>Start with a private conversation about your situation. We establish whether Toza fits and discuss urgency. This conversation includes no device inspection or technical work and does not commit you to purchase.</p>
<p>You then receive a written scope and price. After your acceptance and receipt of payment, we schedule the Assessment.</p>
</div></details></div></section>

