<section class="copy-section is-disclosure" id="what-the-service-covers" aria-labelledby="what-the-service-covers-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><details class="section-disclosure"><summary><h2 id="what-the-service-covers-heading">What the service covers</h2></summary><div class="section-detail">
<p>Toza helps you strengthen the security and privacy of your personal digital life. You can come with a concern, a change in circumstances, or a wish to move beyond the defaults. Separation, business and inheritance disputes are among the situations where access to private information can have serious consequences. We work within your authorized digital environment, on relevant access identified together. This is not a promise to discover every account or remove every possible exposure.</p>
<p>Essential migration covers identity, recovery and critical-service access. Historical archives and bulk data migration require a separately agreed scope. The service does not include investigation of another person, forensic reconstruction, legal advice or routine IT support. The dated record documents the work; it is not a forensic report, evidence document or security guarantee.</p>
<p>You are present and control your credentials. Toza does not keep them for ongoing use or remotely control your devices. Material changes require your approval. <a href="/en/faq.html#privacy">Read how your information is handled</a>.</p>
<p><strong><a href="/en/faq.html#boundaries">See the service boundaries</a></strong></p>
</div></details></div></section>
<section class="copy-section copy-contact" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading"><div class="wrap copy-body"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="contact-heading">You do not need to know where to look.</h2><p>You can start with a concern, a hunch, or a wish to take a more deliberate approach to your digital life. Send a short, neutral WhatsApp or Signal message. Dr. Tabansky replies personally as soon as possible. If the service fits, you receive a written offer with the work, inclusions, exclusions, price, agreed additions and payment terms. Paid work starts only after your explicit acceptance and receipt of payment.</p></div><div class="section-detail">

<p>Suggested message: <strong>&#x201C;I&apos;d like a private conversation. Please let me know the next step.&#x201D;</strong></p>
<p>Do not send passwords, recovery codes, screenshots, legal documents, intimate material or details, or detailed allegations in the first message.</p>
